IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SUM-TWO.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE    PIC X(80).
01 WS-FIRST   PIC X(40).
01 WS-SECOND  PIC X(40).
01 WS-A       PIC S9(18).
01 WS-B       PIC S9(18).
01 WS-SUM     PIC S9(18).
01 WS-OUT     PIC -(18)9.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
*> Read one line with two whole numbers, e.g. "3 4".
    ACCEPT WS-LINE
    UNSTRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-LINE) DELIMITED BY ALL SPACES
        INTO WS-FIRST WS-SECOND
    END-UNSTRING
    COMPUTE WS-A = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-FIRST)
    COMPUTE WS-B = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-SECOND)
    COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-A + WS-B
    MOVE WS-SUM TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "Sum: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
    STOP RUN.
